            "url": "http://store.steampowered.com/news/5436/",
            "content": " \n<a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/92000/\">Hydrophobia: Prophecy</a> is now available on Steam!<br><br>Hydrophobia: Prophecy is the ultimate version of this jaw-dropping action-adventure set onboard a floating city, where terrorists take control and heroine Kate has to overcome her haunting childhood memories to fight back using all her skills and expertise as a systems engineer.<br><br>The comprehensive reinvention of the title includes an upgraded graphics engine, brand new gameplay mechanics, exclusive new levels, a reworked back story including a dramatic new ending, enhanced HydroEngine physics and is over 40% longer.<br><br><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/92000/\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/92000/capsule_467x181.jpg\" style=\" float: left; margin-right: 12px; height: 181px; width: 467px;\"></a>\t\t\t\t"
        },
        {
            "title": "Pre-Purchase Now - Hydrophobia: Prophecy",
            "date": "2011-04-26 20:26:00",
            "url": "http://store.steampowered.com/news/5377/",
            "content": " \n<a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/92000/\">Hydrophobia: Prophecy</a> is now available for Pre-Purchase on Steam.  Pre-purchase before May 9th, 10AM Pacific Time and save 15%!<br><br><i>Hydrophobia: Prophecy</i> is a comprehensive reinvention of the original title that includes upgraded graphics, brand new gameplay mechanics, new levels, a reworked back story, a dramatic new ending, recast voice acting and much, much more. <br><br>Set onboard a floating city overrun by terrorists, Kate must overcome her haunting childhood memories and fight back using all her skills and expertise as a systems engineer in this epic action-adventure tale.<br><br><a href=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/92000/ss_87278bbaeecf3e86704f7c4081d56b7356dab928.1920x1080.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/92000/ss_87278bbaeecf3e86704f7c4081d56b7356dab928.600x338.jpg\" style=\"border: none; float: left; margin-right: 12px;\"></a><a href=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/92000/ss_67cef481a0deac7a9c203639754862fa69fdfb36.1920x1080.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/92000/ss_67cef481a0deac7a9c203639754862fa69fdfb36.600x338.jpg\" style=\"border: none; float: none; margin-right: 12px;\"></a><a href=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/92000/ss_90513583b2442242790aa98de4c4b0d0acf9dcab.1920x1080.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/92000/ss_90513583b2442242790aa98de4c4b0d0acf9dcab.600x338.jpg\" style=\"border: none; float: left; margin-right: 12px;\"></a><a href=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/92000/ss_b8f702b4ea7e5cb735ed64af2b286023648fd827.1920x1080.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/92000/ss_b8f702b4ea7e5cb735ed64af2b286023648fd827.600x338.jpg\" style=\"border: none; float: none; margin-right: 12px;\"></a>\t\t\t\t"
